{title: 005 - All My Hope on God Is Founded}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: Joachim Neander}
{composer: Herbert Howells}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 96}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: Adoration and Praise}

Verse 1:
[F]All [Gm]my [F]hope [F7]on [Dm]God [Gm]is [C7]found[F]ed;
[F]He [Gm]doth [F]still [F7]my [Bb]trust [D7]re[G]new.
[Bb]Me [C]through [Dm]change and [Gm]chance [F]He [Dm]guid[C]eth,
[A]On[Dm]ly [Gm]good [C]and [Gm]on[Am]ly [Dm]true.
[C7]God [F7]un[Bb]known, [F]He [D7]a[Gm]lone
[A7]Calls [Bb]my heart [F]to [Gm]be [C7]His [F]own.

Verse 2:
[F]Pride [Gm]of [F]man [F7]and [Dm]earth[Gm]ly [C7]glo[F]ry,
[F]Sword [Gm]and [F]crown [F7]be[Bb]tray [D7]his [G]trust;
[Bb]What [C]with [Dm]care and [Gm]toil [F]he [Dm]build[C]eth,
[A]Tower [Dm]and [Gm]tem[C]ple [Gm]fall [Am]to [Dm]dust.
[C7]But [F7]God's [Bb]power, [F]hour [D7]by [Gm]hour,
[A7]Is [Bb]my temple [F]and [Gm]my [C7] [F]tower.

Verse 3:
[F]God's [Gm]great [F]good[F7]ness [Dm]aye [Gm]en[C7]dur[F]eth,
[F]Deep [Gm]His [F]wis[F7]dom, [Bb]pass[D7]ing [G]thought;
[Bb]Splen[C]dor, [Dm]light and [Gm]life [F]at[Dm]tend [C]Him,
[A]Beau[Dm]ty [Gm]spring[C]eth [Gm]out [Am]of [Dm]naught.
[C7]Love [F7]doth [Bb]stand [F]at [D7]His [Gm]hand;
[A7]Joy [Bb]doth wait [F]on [Gm]His [C7]com[F]mand.

Verse 4:
[F]Still [Gm]from [F]man [F7]to [Dm]God [Gm]e[C7]ter[F]nal,
[F]Sac[Gm]ri[F]fice [F7]of [Bb]praise [D7]be [G]done.
[Bb]High [C]a[Dm]bove all [Gm]prais[F]es [Dm]prais[C]ing,
[A]For [Dm]the [Gm]gift [C]of [Gm]Christ [Am]His [Dm]Son.
[C7]Christ [F7]doth [Bb]call [F]one [D7]and [Gm]all:
[A7]Ye [Bb]who follow [F]shall [Gm]not [C7] [F]fall.
